=== meta
title = "Back up your photos"
===

# Back up your photos {#backup}

Plug in the external drive and copy the folder across.

=== code {#cmd lang=sh}
rsync -a ~/Pictures/ /Volumes/Backup/Pictures/
===

Then check that nothing was left behind.

## Check {#check}

Compare what each place holds.

=== table {#counts format=csv header=1}
place, photos
laptop, 2140
drive, 2140
===

If the numbers differ, run the copy again.
